                        <div class="accordion-item__content">
                                                                                            <div class="type-body-xs"><p>This show takes place at Park Theatre. </p>
</div>
                                <div class="type-body-xs"><p>More information on <a href="https://parktheatre.co.uk/visit-eat-and-drink/how-to-get-here/">how to get here.</a></p>
<p>Further access information can be found <a href="https://parktheatre.co.uk/visit-eat-and-drink/accessibility/">here</a>.</p>
<p><strong>Latecomers may not be admitted.</strong></p>
<p><strong>Emirates Stadium fixtures</strong><br />
Finsbury Park station and the surrounding area can get very busy when Arsenal play at home. <a href="https://www.fixturecalendar.com/stadium-emirates-stadium" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See Fixtures</a></p>
</div>
