                                        <h3 class="type-body-s">Derek Scott Mitchell </h3>
                                                                            </div>

                                    
                                                                            <template data-dialog-content="dialog-person-cast-and-creatives-6adca6b6bb0ff">
                                            <article class="person-dialog">
                                                <div class="person-dialog__image">
                                                    <img width="450" height="450" src="https://ekvp6a2k2ff.exactdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Untitled-design-450x450.jpg?strip=all" class="attachment-1:1@450 size-1:1@450" alt="" data-skip-lazy="true" decoding="async" srcset="https://ekvp6a2k2ff.exactdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Untitled-design-450x450.jpg?strip=all 450w, https://ekvp6a2k2ff.exactdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Untitled-design-900x900.jpg?strip=all 900w, https://ekvp6a2k2ff.exactdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Untitled-design-850x850.jpg?strip=all 850w, https://ekvp6a2k2ff.exactdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Untitled-design-1024x1024.jpg?strip=all 1024w, https://ekvp6a2k2ff.exactdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Untitled-design.jpg?strip=all&amp;zoom=0.2&amp;resize=450%2C450 90w, https://ekvp6a2k2ff.exactdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Untitled-design.jpg?strip=all&amp;zoom=0.4&amp;resize=450%2C450 180w, https://ekvp6a2k2ff.exactdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Untitled-design.jpg?strip=all&amp;zoom=0.6&amp;resize=450%2C450 270w, https://ekvp6a2k2ff.exactdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Untitled-design.jpg?strip=all&amp;zoom=0.8&amp;resize=450%2C450 360w" sizes="(max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px" />

                                                                                                            <ul role="list" class="social-links" aria-label="Social media links">
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </ul>
                                                                                                    </div>


                                                <div class="person-dialog__content">
                                                    <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                                        <h2>Derek Scott Mitchell </h2>

                                                                                                            </div>

                                                    <div class="person-dialog__bio">
                                                        <p class="type-body-xl"></p>

                                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio__main__text">
                                                            <p><b><span data-contrast="auto">Derek Mitchell</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> (writer/performer, </span><i><span data-contrast="auto">Elio/Eliot</span></i><span data-contrast="auto"> and other characters) is a Dutch-American actor, comedian and writer-performer known for his multilingual character work and experimentation with genre and form across digital and live formats. His sketch accounts </span><i><span data-contrast="auto">@derekscottmitchell</span></i><span data-contrast="auto"> and </span><i><span data-contrast="auto">@letsdoubledutch</span></i><span data-contrast="auto"> have amassed over a million followers and a billion views globally, with viral hits spanning cultural satire and surreal character comedy.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">He appeared in the third series of </span><i><span data-contrast="auto">Ted Lasso</span></i><span data-contrast="auto"> (Apple TV+) and has toured hundreds of sold-out live comedy shows across the UK, Europe, and the USA. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">His stage credits include </span><i><span data-contrast="auto">F**king Men</span></i><span data-contrast="auto"> (Waterloo East Theatre, 2023) and </span><i><span data-contrast="auto">Baby in the Mirror</span></i><span data-contrast="auto"> (Summerhall, 2025), directed by Sammy Glover. Derek began his comedy career as one half of the sketch duo </span><i><span data-contrast="auto">Horseplay</span></i><span data-contrast="auto"> together with Kathy Maniura, and continues to develop work that blends absurdist humour with bold theatricality.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">At the 2024 Edinburgh Fringe, his five-star debut standup hour </span><i><span data-contrast="auto">Double Dutch</span></i><span data-contrast="auto"> was named one of </span><i><span data-contrast="auto">i</span></i><span data-contrast="auto"> paper’s 31 Best Shows of the Festival and praised as “a masterclass” (</span><i><span data-contrast="auto">The Comic’s Comic</span></i><span data-contrast="auto">), “extraordinary” (</span><i><span data-contrast="auto">LMAOnaise</span></i><span data-contrast="auto">) and “very special” (</span><i><span data-contrast="auto">Broadway Baby</span></i><span data-contrast="auto">).</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Goblin has been developed alongside his digital and live comedy work, beginning in 2022. The development journey has proven a great adventure and formative experiment in blending genre and tone, with the unparalleled support of the show’s creative dream team who’ve been on board since the very beginning.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>

                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </article>
                                        </template>
                                    
                                    


