			    <div
        class="card__meta margin-trim card__clickable">
                            <p class="card__dates type-h6" aria-label="Date: 2 Dec 2026 &ndash; 10 Jan 2027">2 Dec 2026 &ndash; 10 Jan 2027</p>
            </div>

												<div class="card__summary ">
						This Christmas, return to Pemberley as Pride and Prejudice continues through Mary Bennet’s eyes. Smart, funny and emotionally incisive, this UK premiere reimagines Austen’s overlooked heroine in a witty festive tale of family, love and finding the courage to rewrite your own story. 
					</div>
							
			
			    <div class="card__actions">
        <a href="https://parktheatre.co.uk/events/miss-bennet-christmas-at-pemberley/" class="card__fill-link">
            <span class="sr-text">Find out more about
                Miss Bennet: Christmas at Pemberley</span>
        </a>

        <ul aria-label="Venue and book button" class="card__content__ul has-venue">
                            <li class="" aria-label="Venue: Park200">
                    <span class="Park200"></span>
                                            <div>Park<b class="numnber">200</b></div>
                                    </li>
            
            <li class="">
                
                    
